'''Ashfang''' is a [[Mob]] and {{MobCategory|mb}} that spawns in the {{Zone|Ruins of Ashfang}} in the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}. 

== Spawning ==
* '''Ashfang''' spawn {{green|2}} minutes after being defeated at {{Coords|-485|137|-1016}}.
* They are naturally neutral. Attacking them starts the fight.

== Behavior ==
* At all times, the '''Ashfang''' twins are immobile and exhibit the [[File:Iron Chestplate.png|21px|link=]] {{gold|Scorched Barrier}} property which nullifies all attacks against them except from [[File:Burning Eye (v1).png|16px|link=y]] {{orange|Blazing Souls}}.
* They are naturally neutral. Attacking them starts the fight:
** [[File:Iron Chestplate.png|21px|link=]] {{gold|Scorched Barrier}} now deals {{stat|dmg|40% of Max HP}} per second to all players within its area of effect, indicated by a ring of flames.
** The fight alternates between {{green|2}} phases: a '''Summons''' phase lasting {{green|50}} seconds and a '''Healing''' phase lasting about {{green|10}} seconds.

