===Summons Phase===
This phase begins with '''Ashfang''' using [[File:Blaze Head.png|21px|link=]] {{gold|Summons}}, and after {{green|15}} seconds, [[File:Rekindled Ember Fragment (v1).png|21px|link=]] {{Red|Gravity Orbs}}.
* [[File:Blaze Head.png|21px|link=]] {{gold|Summons}}: {{green|12}} of them are summoned at once in a circle around '''Ashfang''': {{green|4}} [[File:Blaze Sprite.png|16px|link=]] [[Ashfang Follower|{{grey|Followers}}]], {{green|4}} [[File:Blaze Sprite.png|16px|link=]] [[Ashfang Acolyte|{{blue|Acolytes}}]] and {{green|4}} [[File:Blaze Sprite.png|16px|link=]] [[Ashfang Underling|{{red|Underlings}}]]. 
* [[File:Rekindled Ember Fragment (v1).png|21px|link=]] {{Red|Gravity Orb}}: {{green|3}} of them are summoned over a period of {{green|3}} seconds after which they suck up nearby players and [[File:Blaze Sprite.png|16px|link=]] {{grey|Ashfang Followers}}. They despawn at the end of the phase although luring [[File:Blaze Sprite.png|16px|link=]] {{grey|Ashfang Followers}} into one causes it to explode after {{green|5}} seconds, killing them. Players touching one take {{si|dmg|5,000}} every second.
* [[File:Obsidian.png|21px|link=y]] {{red|Noxious Ash Cloud}}: occasionally lob an {{ID|Obsidian}} block, lingering for {{green|5}} seconds before dissipating. Deals {{DamageType|Wither}} every second for {{green|10}} seconds, which is refreshed upon re-entering the cloud.

As for the summons themselves:
* [[File:Fire Charge.png|21px|link=]] {{red|Fireball}}: shot at the player, dealing {{stat|dmg}} on impact.
* [[File:Barrier.png|21px|link=]] {{red|Cryogenic Blast}}: only shot by {{MobSprite|Ashfang Follower|alt={{gray|Ashfang Followers}}}} while following a player, dealing {{si|dmg|2,000}} on impact, disabling abilities and slowing them down for {{green|5}} seconds. 
* [[File:Burning Eye (v1).png|21px|link=]]{{orange|Blazing Soul}}: upon killing any minion, spawns at its death location and despawns after {{green|10}} seconds; punching one launches it in the direction the player is facing. Deals a static {{si|dmg|2,000,000}} to {{MobSprite|Ashfang}}.

===Healing Phase===
* [[File:Splash Potion of Healing.png|21px|link=]] {{gold|Immense Healing}} : the '''Ashfang''' twins absorb the remaining summons, healing {{Hp|250,000}} per. This does not spawn [[File:Burning Eye (v1).png|21px|link=]] {{gold|Blazing Souls}}.

