== Bestiary ==
{{Bestiary Entry|section=Crimson Isle|lore=They also call themselves "The Twins".|bracket=7|max_tier=15}}

==Tips==
* {{Item|Netherrack-Looking Sunshade}} removes the hazard of {{MobSprite|Dive Ghast}}s during the night.
* {{Item|Gyrokinetic Wand}} bundles the summons together, easing the lure of {{MobSprite|Ashfang Follower|alt={{gray|Ashfang Followers}}}}.
* The combination of [[File:Barrier.png|21px|link=]] {{red|Cryogenic Blast}} and [[File:Rekindled Ember Fragment (v1).png|21px|link=]] {{red|Gravity Orbs}} is fatal.
* Luring {{MobSprite|Ashfang Follower|alt={{gray|Ashfang Followers}}}} relies on keeping a distance that is ''small'' enough to keep them following the player and ''big'' enough to not get trapped in a [[File:Rekindled Ember Fragment (v1).png|21px|link=]] {{red|Gravity Orb}}.

== Trivia ==
* [[File:Burning Eye (v1).png|21px|link=]]{{orange|Blazing Souls}} use the old texture of {{Item|Burning Eye}}.

